  "term": "video conferencing",
  "definition": "Video conferencing is a way of meeting online using live video and audio. In the supplied source, it is described as useful for continuing education, work, and social contact, but also as sometimes contributing to fatigue and social disconnection because it can make smooth interaction and social bonding harder.",
